{
  "job_C16.5_20251003_115218": {
    "chunk_text": "Luna I qui natus fuerit, uitalis erit se \u00fee acenned bi\u00f0 liflic he bi\u00f0. Luna secunda, mediocris erit medeme he bi\u00f0. Luna tertia, infirmus erit untrum he bi\u00f0. Luna IIII, tractatus regnum erit trahtnere cyninga he bi\u00f0. Luna V, iuuenis tolletur geog he bi\u00f0 genumen. Luna sexta, uitalis erit liflic he bi\u00f0. Luna VII, uitalis et utilis erit liflic & notwur\u00f0e he bi\u00f0. Luna VIII iuuenis decidet geog he afealle\u00f0. Luna IX, omnium adquisitor erit ealra strinend he bi\u00f0. Luna X circuibit multa regiones he abuten f\u00e6r\u00f0 fela rica. Luna XI, omnium adquisitor erit ealra strinend he bi\u00f0. Luna XII, reliosus erit \u00e6wf\u00e6st he bi\u00f0. Luna XIII, aduersus impeditor erit wi\u00f0erweard letted he bi\u00f0. Luna XIIII, omnium tractator erit ealra trahtnere he bi\u00f0. Luna XV, iuuenis morietur geog swylt. Luna XVI, uitalis et pauper erit liflic & \u00feearfa he bi\u00f0. Luna XVIII, non diu uiuet na lange he ne leofa\u00f0. Luna XIX, in honore erit on wyr\u00f0scipe he bi\u00f0. Luna XX, bellator erit feohtere he bi\u00f0. Luna XXI, latro ingeniosus erit scea\u00fea \u00feancful he bi\u00f0. Luna XXII, laboriosus erit geswincful he bi\u00f0. Luna XXIII, uulgarus erit widcu\u00f0 he bi\u00f0. Luna XXIIII, copios erit genihtsum he bi\u00f0. Luna XXV, pericula multa patietur fr\u00e6cnyssa feala he \u00feola\u00f0. Luna XXVI, nec diues nec pauper erit na welig na w\u00e6dla he bi\u00f0. Luna XXVII, amicus erit freond he bi\u00f0. Luna",
